    <!-- TODO native review: translated without a native speaker; the existing translation mixed
         Shona with English loanwords, and this keeps that register deliberately. -->
    <string name="info_message">1. Dhonza pasi runyorwa rwemarates kuti usvenure, kana kushandisa Svenura Zvese pamenyu. Kusvenura kwega kwega kunodya mari imwe.\n\n2. Marates anozvisvenurawo ega ari kumashure. Marongero anodzora kuti kangani, kana kuzvidzima.\n\n3. Nyora mari mune chero mari kuti ushandure uchibva pairi. Mamwe marates ese anochinja.\n\n4. Baya nyeredzi kuti mari irambe iri pamusoro, kana kuswaipa kadhi kuti uivanze. Mari yakavanzwa inodzoka nepamenyu.\n\n5. Shandisa bhatani re + kuwedzera rate rako, pane zvisiri muapp.\n\n6. Baya zita renyika riri pasi perate kuti uone kwarabva.\n\n7. Wedzera widget pahome screen rako kuti uverenge marates usingavhuri app.</string>
